  "title": "Grilled Turkey Reubens",
  "description": "Toasted, salty, and tangy, reuben sandwiches are classic! This recipe is made with turkey instead of the corned beef and mayonnaise with hot sauce instead of Thousand Island dressing. This updated Reuben will satisfy with a full and slightly spicy flavor.",
